WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
The curved edge of the Earth, seen from the International Space Station, under black space

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Brown land under thin cloud, with white clouds along the edges

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Small bright reflections of sunlight move slowly across the land
